/*
  Petto device firmware (ESP32-S3 N16R8, ST7789 240x240, INMP441, MAX98357A, MPU6050, 3 buttons).
  Hardware as built: firmware/HARDWARE_HANDOFF.md. Brain calls: docs/hardware/DEVICE_PROTOCOL.md.

  Arduino IDE: board "ESP32S3 Dev Module", PSRAM "OPI PSRAM", Flash Size 16MB,
  Partition "16M Flash (3MB APP/9.9MB FATFS)", USB CDC On Boot "Disabled", upload on the UART USB-C.
  Libraries: Adafruit GFX, Adafruit ST7735 and ST7789, ArduinoJson 7, QRCode (Richard Moore).
  Serial Monitor 115200, type h for commands.

  Buttons: A (left) back / up, B (middle) menu / select, hold B to talk, C (right) pat / down.
  Motion: shake = dizzy, gentle rocking = sleepy. Both sync to the brain as care.

  Never logs chat text, transcripts or secrets (CLAUDE.md rules 3 and 4).
*/
